    Bug 2034749 - Fix premature compose window closure and hanging progress dialog on NNTP send failures. r=mkmelin


    This fixes a regression from Bug 2030913 where failing to send a newsgroup
    message resulted in the compose window closing prematurely and the progress
    dialog hanging indefinitely.

    * Fixes a logic error in `nsMsgComposeSendListener::OnStopSending` where the
      FCC (Sent folder copy) check was incorrectly hoisted outside the success
      block, causing it to evaluate even on send failures.
    * Restores the error-handling branch in `nsMsgComposeSendListener::OnStopSending`
      to ensure the send progress dialog is properly closed when a send error occurs,
      bypassing the FCC check.
    * Promisifies `_deliverAsNews` in `MessageSend.sys.mjs` using
     `Promise.withResolvers()` and a wrapper `nsIUrlListener`.
    * Awaits `_deliverAsNews()` to block execution until the NNTP server responds

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D296309

diff --git a/mailnews/compose/src/MessageSend.sys.mjs b/mailnews/compose/src/MessageSend.sys.mjs
